  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chejezhi Africa Zambia Cooking Oil Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chejezhi Africa - Zambia is a community-based organization situated in Mwinilunga District, 300 Kilometers from Solwezi, the provincial capital of North-western province. The organization works with womens groups in six chiefdoms with a total membership of 500. The organization wishes to establish a processing and marketing enterprise that will purchase groundnuts from members and the community and process it into cooking oil for sell to the community and surrounding locations.</narrative>
  </description>
